  "title": "DCS: Giving the power of configuration to the user",
  "summary": "If you’re not familiar with Blend, think of us as a modern experience for getting a loan. We offer a guided, personalized front end application that makes it easy for borrowers to connect their account data and more structured and secure for lenders to process it. We process loan applications for over 130 financial institutions including Wells Fargo and US Bank. To make the borrowing experience seamless, we integrate behind the scenes with our customers’ in-house tech stacks and dozens of third-party vendors.",
